    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Every morning, check what is coming up\nNothing happens when a renewal approaches \u2014 no system emits an\nevent for a date getting nearer. So we go and look, every day,\nand work out how many days are left on each subscription.\nGoHighLevel cannot do this at all.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 860,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "212230445776",
      "name": "1. Every morning, check what is coming up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Escalate at 90, 60, 30 and 7 days\nEach milestone does something different and more urgent: start\nthe conversation, confirm they intend to renew, open a renewal\nopportunity in the pipeline, then escalate. A renewal is never\nlost because nobody remembered it.",
        "height": 890,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 6
      },
